Requirements received from the payment processor (AllayPay underwriting)
in July 2026. This doc records the request verbatim and how each item is
implemented, so future audits don't "fix" the changes away.
`docs/COMPLIANCE` remains the canonical baseline; this doc layers the
July 2026 feedback on top of it.

